                  "typeName": "dsDescriptionValue",
                  "multiple": false,
                  "typeClass": "primitive",
                  "value": "Artifacts for the paper \"Designing a Quantum Network Protocol\" which was accepted to CoNEXT 2020.\r\n<br><br>\r\nThe artifacts include:<br>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>the software code to run the simulations and reproduce the results</li>\r\n<li>the raw data used to plot the figures in the paper</li>\r\n</ul><br>\r\nInstallations and setup instructions are included in the zip file in the README.md file. The EXPERIMENTS.md file contains instructions necessary to reproduce the data for this paper."
